// Hand-written Dart FFI bindings for the TinyTrainer C engine (src/tinygpt.h).
//
// NOT generated by ffigen (this VM has no libclang, and hand-written bindings
// keep the exact C signatures under our control). If the C header changes,
// update this file to match it symbol for symbol.
//
// Symbol resolution: these @ffi.Native declarations are linked to the native
// library produced by hook/build.dart (assetName matches this file name).
// Do not rename this file without updating hook/build.dart.
//
// NOTE on C `long`: tg_param_count / tg_get_step / tg_corpus_tokens return
// C `long`. On LP64 (Linux/macOS/Android/iOS 64-bit) that is 64-bit; on
// Windows LLP64 it is 32-bit but the x86-64 ABI zero-extends a 32-bit return
// into the full register. All three values are non-negative counts that fit
// in 31 bits for any realistic model, so Int64 is correct on every target.
//
// NOTE on strings: `Utf8` is from package:ffi (dart:ffi has no Utf8 type).
// It extends dart:ffi's Opaque, so Pointer<Utf8> is a valid native type.
